&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-likec4-why-like&#34;&gt;What is LikeC4? Why &amp;ldquo;like&amp;rdquo;?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;LikeC4 is a modeling language for describing software architecture and tools to generate diagrams from the model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LikeC4 is inspired by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://c4model.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;C4 Model&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/structurizr/dsl&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Structurizr DSL&lt;/a&gt;, but provides some flexibility.
You customize or define your own notation, element types, and any number of nested levels in architecture model.&lt;br&gt;
Perfectly tailored to your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-does-likec4-look-like&#34;&gt;What does LikeC4 look like?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;LikeC4 source:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/likec4/.github/assets/824903/c0f22106-dba6-469e-ab47-85e7b8565513&#34; width=&#34;675px&#34;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./packages/likec4/README.md&#34; &gt;CLI&lt;/a&gt; to preview:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
